issue_context.body:
When you have:

`output * bg .. ` after your outputs where you use the model make version output config, then on reload your positions will be wrong.
Weirdly the positions are correct and does not occur with regular output identifiers.. 

If you put the `output * bg ..` before the other output commands then reloading works as expected and positions are good.

It seems something goes wrong with merging..

